      "parameters": {
        "width": 608,
        "height": 656,
        "content": "# Contract Auto-Renewal Intelligence Workflow\n\n## How it works:\n\nThis workflow automatically monitors supplier contracts and identifies renewal risks before auto-renewal occurs. It retrieves contract data from Google Sheets, calculates remaining contract duration, and evaluates risk based on auto-renewal clauses, notice periods, supplier ratings, and usage levels.\nMedium and High-risk contracts are analyzed by AI to generate renewal recommendations. The procurement team receives Slack alerts, and all actions are logged in Google Sheets for tracking and audit purposes.\n\n## Setup Steps:\n\n1. Fetch contract data from Google Sheets.\n2. Standardize contract information.\n3. Calculate renewal risk.\n4. Filter Medium and High-risk contracts.\n5. Generate AI recommendations.\n6. Send Slack notifications.\n7. Log actions in Google Sheets.\n"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
